#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/ppp-and-slip/_index.adoc:62
#, fuzzy
msgid "How to set up PPP over ATM (PPPoA)."
msgstr "如何设置 ATM 上的 PPP（PPPoA）。"

