#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/ppp-and-slip/_index.adoc:66
msgid "Be familiar with basic network terminology."
msgstr "熟悉基本网络术语。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/ppp-and-slip/_index.adoc:67
